# A wingback reading armchair facing the viewer. Four pixels wider than its
# tile on each side, so the arms hug whoever sits in it. zbias -1 paints it
# before the person on the same tile; the arms sit outside the body's columns
# so nothing has to paint over them. Frame "throw" has a blanket on one arm.
sprite library-armchair
size 24 36
layer object
footprint 1 1
origin 4 20
zbias -1
tag chair seat library
spot read 0 0 down read sit
variant rust T=r 6=R 7=8 t=y
variant sage T=s 6=S 7=0 t=s

frame default
